    <string name="sauvegarde_automatique">Automatic backup…</string>
    <string name="sauvegarde_explication">Your list is written to a file at a place you choose once, then updated by itself at each change.\n\nPrefer an online storage space rather than the phone itself: if the phone is lost, the list is not. On another phone, “Import a list…” brings it back.</string>
